Package: nosqli
Version: 0.5.4
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Alienkrishn [Anon4You]
Depends: git, golang
Section: web
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/Charlie-belmer/nosqli
Description: NoSQL injection detection and exploitation tool
 nosqli is a fast NoSQL injection scanner and injector written in Go.
 It supports error‑based, boolean‑blind, and timing‑based detection
 for MongoDB and other NoSQL databases.
